blocks.explanation:
Kidney failure woh haalat hai jis mein gurde khoon se fuzlaat chhaanne aur pani-namak ka tawazun rakhne ki salahiyat kho dete hain.

(i) Acute kidney failure (kidney injury) achanak hota hai aur aksar ilaj se theek ho jata hai. Wajuhaat:
1. gurde ka infection;
2. urinary tract mein rukawat (pathri, bladder cancer ya bara prostate);
3. NSAIDs jaisi kuch dawayein;
4. renal arteries ya arterioles mein khoon ke lothre.

(ii) Chronic kidney failure lambe arse mein hota hai aur na-qabil-e-wapsi hai, is liye gurde apna kaam wapas nahi pa sakte. Tab fuzlaat masnooi tareeqon (renal dialysis: haemodialysis ya peritoneal dialysis) se chhaane jate hain, ya end-stage failure mein na-kaam gurda donor ke sehatmand gurde se badla jata hai (kidney transplant).
